# Conversation State

Maintain explicit per-call state. Never use mutable globals for caller-specific state. Each call must be isolated.

State may include: call ID, room ID, participant identity, conversation stage, collected entities, completed actions, failed tool attempts, handoff status, call start time, last activity time.

Do not rely only on prompt history for important business state. Store required workflow state in typed application objects.
